{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And these are the judgments.</b> In the preceding section the warning was not to covet all that belongs to your fellow (Exodus 20:14), and these are the judgments by which a person knows what constitutes all that belongs to his fellow." "<b>Which you shall set before them.</b> For these involve neither positive nor negative commandments like the prohibitions of the preceding section, but rather when the need arises to judge, they shall judge according to this manner."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:26:37.633681626Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}